        <mxCell id="note" value="&lt;b&gt;Cache-Aside Pattern&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. FastAPI checks Redis first&lt;br&gt;2. On cache miss → query PostgreSQL&lt;br&gt;3. Store result back in Redis&lt;br&gt;4. Return response to client"
